    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Invading Dark is a first person, survival game where you will trying to escape the map.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize various items scattered throughout the map to stay safe. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade the creature's sight of view to increase your chance of escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are randomized hazards and events throughout the map to affect exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your health and base's hp using the gathered items to bide time to be able to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and gain perks to help you survive and escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Invading Dark is a first person, survival game where you will trying to escape the map.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize various items scattered throughout the map to stay safe. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade the creature's sight of view to increase your chance of escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are randomized hazards and events throughout the map to affect exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your health and base's hp using the gathered items to bide time to be able to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and gain perks to help you survive and escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A single player survival horror game where creatures are invading from the dark and hunting the inhabitants. You must survive and find different pages of notes to get an escape route to safety.",
